-foreground-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/#services\">Special Occasions</a></li></ul></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-display font-semibold mb-4\">Contact</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-foreground-muted text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone \"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg><a href=\"tel:+33 6 15 96 30 46\" class=\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\">+33 6 15 96 30 46</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-foreground-muted text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail \"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><a href=\"mailto:adrian@tabledadrian.com\" class=\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\">adrian@tabledadrian.com</a></li></ul><p class=\"text-foreground-subtle text-xs mt-4\">Typically responds within 24 hours</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-border flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center space-y-4 md:space-y-0\" style=\"opacity:0\"><p class=\"text-foreground-subtle text-sm\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Table d&#x27;Adrian. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex space-x-6 text-sm\"><a class=\"text-foreground-subtle hover:text-foregr